.08,Captions,,0,0,0,,OuchComment: 0,0:28:53.25,0:28:53.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,OuchComment: 1,0:28:53.25,0:28:53.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,OuchDialogue: 5,0:01:50.17,0:01:52.46,Title,,0,0,0,,Iceburg-sanDialogue: 6,0:01:50.17,0:01:52.46,Title,,0,0,0,,Iceburg-sanDialogue: 5,0:01:52.90,0:01:55.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is great!Dialogue: 5,0:01:55.97,0:01:58.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! I'm counting on you!Dialogue: 5,0:01:59.64,0:02:03.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who would've imagined these creatures could be so convenient! Dialogue: 5,0:02:03.64,0:02:05.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a pretty smooth ride. Comfy, too!Dialogue: 5,0:02:06.80,0:02:08.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To the right! Right!Dialogue: 5,0:02:08.27,0:02:10.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The ball is headed your way!Dialogue: 5,0:02:09.10,0:02:10.19,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Here we go!Dialogue: 5,0:02:11.90,0:02:14.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! Stop the ball!Dialogue: 5,0:02:19.66,0:02:22.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pass the ball! Pass the ball!Dialogue: 5,0:02:20.16,0:02:22.25,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,So cool!Dialogue: 5,0:02:26.90,0:02:30.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like a residential area.Dialogue: 5,0:02:31.69,0:02:35.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This town was certainly built with canals in mind.Dialogue: 5,0:02:42.51,0:02:43.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 5,0:02:45.10,0:02:48.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, there's an incline.  It's fine if we go against the flow, right?Dialogue: 5,0:02:48.70,0:02:50.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can we go up?Dialogue: 5,0:02:56.39,0:02:58.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait! Wrong way! Go right! Right!Dialogue: 5,0:02:58.49,0:03:02.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They can even go uphill against the water, huh?Dialogue: 5,0:03:02.23,0:03:03.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not bad, you guys!Dialogue: 5,0:03:07.58,0:03:09.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are canals even on the rooftops!Dialogue: 5,0:03:09.79,0:03:14.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we're going the wrong way! We have to go to the shopping district first!Dialogue: 5,0:03:14.88,0:03:17.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? What's the hurry?Dialogue: 5,0:03:17.15,0:03:20.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not every day you get to walk along the canals.Dialogue: 5,0:03:20.34,0:03:21.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?Dialogue: 5,0:03:20.97,0:03:21.84,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 5,0:03:21.84,0:03:25.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! L-Look! Look ahead!Dialogue: 5,0:03:26.13,0:03:29.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right! We're at the top of the hill!Dialogue: 5,0:03:29.60,0:03:31.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Which means...Dialogue: 5,0:03:49.29,0:03:51.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're flying!Dialogue: 5,0:03:51.04,0:03:52.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're falling. We're falling. We're falling. We're falling.Dialogue: 5,0:03:52.78,0:03:53.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're falling. We're falling. We're falling.Dialogue: 5,0:03:53.79,0:03:58.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're falling!Dialogue: 5,0:04:07.00,0:04:09.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be so reckless!Dialogue: 5,0:04:13.69,0:04:14.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 5,0:04:15.40,0:04:17.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Miss! Our goods are cheap!Dialogue: 5,0:04:17.49,0:04:20.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How about taking a look at our products?Dialogue: 5,0:04:24.61,0:04:27.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have lots of rare, quality items!Dialogue: 5,0:04:27.58,0:04:30.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now starting our 50%-off sale!Dialogue: 5,0:04:31.54,0:04:34.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow! Things sure are lively!Dialogue: 5,0:04:34.80,0:04:37.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? We ended up in the shopping district!Dialogue: 5,0:04:37.29,0:04:39.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what you took was actually a shortcut?Dialogue: 5,0:04:41.88,0:04:45.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry! You guys are pretty smart after all!Dialogue: 5,0:04:45.42,0:04:49.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've never been to such a busy shopping district!Dialogue: 5,0:04:49.29,0:04:52.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Check it out! That bull is huge!Dialogue: 5,0:04:52.70,0:04:55.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Hey, it's headed this way!Dialogue: 5,0:05:01.28,0:05:03.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This guy's a monster!Dialogue: 5,0:05:03.00,0:05:04.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He'd eat us whole!Dialogue: 5,0:05:04.20,0:05:06.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's a king size.Dialogue: 5,0:05:07.28,0:05:09.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm? What's up with them?Dialogue: 5,0:05:10.20,0:05:12.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Masks?Dialogue: 5,0:05:12.12,0:05:14.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow. They're gorgeous.Dialogue: 5,0:05:14.70,0:05:16.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Some kind of party?Dialogue: 5,0:05:18.70,0:05:20.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? What's going on?Dialogue: 5,0:05:21.09,0:05:24.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come and get 'em! Hot and fresh hydro takoyaki!Dialogue: 5,0:05:25.55,0:05:28.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, that's two hydro croquettes?Dialogue: 5,0:05:28.01,0:05:32.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Both look yummy! Yagara, go over that way.Dialogue: 5,0:05:32.47,0:05:34.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! What's the big idea?!Dialogue: 5,0:05:34.89,0:05:37.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy! Where're you going?!Dialogue: 5,0:05:37.00,0:05:39.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ask the yagara!Dialogue: 5,0:05:45.74,0:05:48.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Welcome! What'll it be?Dialogue: 5,0:05:48.28,0:05:51.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you were hungry.Dialogue: 5,0:05:51.49,0:05:56.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Although it's normally for people,  hydro meat is the yagaras' favorite food.Dialogue: 5,0:05:56.10,0:05:58.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hydro? Then gimme ten!Dialogue: 5,0:05:59.30,0:06:02.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're so good the cooks from  Gourmet Town buy them in secret.Dialogue: 5,0:06:02.99,0:06:05.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It melts in your mouth, really hitting the spot, right?Dialogue: 5,0:06:08.30,0:06:13.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It... is... so... juicy!Dialogue: 5,0:06:13.10,0:06:15.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yummy!Dialogue: 5,0:06:13.99,0:06:15.20,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! It's that good?Dialogue: 5,0:06:15.20,0:06:17.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy! Toss one over here!Dialogue: 5,0:06:17.29,0:06:19.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! Go buy your own!Dialogue: 5,0:06:19.90,0:06:20.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 5,0:06:20.99,0:06:23.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami! Pull the boat over to that shop!Dialogue: 5,0:06:24.60,0:06:28.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,More masks? They seem to be all over town.Dialogue: 5,0:06:29.00,0:06:30.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,People are wearing them everywhere.Dialogue: 5,0:06:32.90,0:06:35.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami!Dialogue: 5,0:06:37.39,0:06:40.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay. For the last leg  of our trip to Shipyard Island,Dialogue: 5,0:06:40.89,0:06:42.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we go up a water elevator.Dialogue: 5,0:06:45.00,0:06:46.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A water elevator?Dialogue: 5,0:06:46.84,0:06:49.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's that tower-like thing.Dialogue: 5,0:06:55.89,0:06:58.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make your way inside, please!Dialogue: 5,0:06:58.77,0:07:02.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the Shipyard Island elevator.Dialogue: 5,0:07:02.73,0:07:10.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It goes to the dockyards and downtown Water Seven!Dialogue: 5,0:07:11.41,0:07:14.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please make your way inside the gate!Dialogue: 5,0:07:14.09,0:07:17.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One minute until it closes!Dialogue: 5,0:07:18.66,0:07:21.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's gonna happen inside?Dialogue: 5,0:07:27.55,0:07:30.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! They closed the gate behind us!Dialogue: 5,0:07:31.21,0:07:33.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're going up! We're going up! We're going up!Dialogue: 5,0:07:37.56,0:07:41.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. That happens. Then this happens.Dialogue: 5,0:07:41.40,0:07:44.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And then, they do this and that. So that's why it's a water gate elevator.Dialogue: 5,0:07:44.52,0:07:48.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Water Seven is pretty neat!Dialogue: 5,0:07:49.89,0:07:52.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So they use water for all sorts of things!Dialogue: 5,0:07:59.00,0:08:00.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 5,0:08:00.58,0:08:03.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who're you calling "Moss Head"?Dialogue: 5,0:08:04.60,0:08:05.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro.Dialogue: 5,0:08:07.46,0:08:10.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Huh? – Where's Robin-chan ? She isn't on the ship.Dialogue: 5,0:08:10.53,0:08:11.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?Dialogue: 5,0:08:12.51,0:08:16.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, she isn't. She went out with Chopper earlier.Dialogue: 5,0:08:16.97,0:08:20.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?! – She said she was going shopping.Dialogue: 5,0:08:20.54,0:08:24.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?! Then you're the only one on the ship?Dialogue: 5,0:08:24.40,0:08:27.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How boring is that!?Dialogue: 5,0:08:27.59,0:08:30.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got that right.Dialogue: 5,0:08:30.99,0:08:34.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, then.  I'm going grocery shopping.Dialogue: 5,0:08:34.72,0:08:36.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Watch the ship while I'm gone.Dialogue: 5,0:08:39.54,0:08:42.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geez, he's already asleep.Dialogue: 5,0:08:42.30,0:08:44.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever. She's all yours.Dialogue: 5,0:09:13.82,0:09:16.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're here!Dialogue: 5,0:09:20.20,0:09:25.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So this is downtown Water Seven with the world's greatest shipyard?!Dialogue: 5,0:09:31.61,0:09:34.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like there's more land  than water around here.Dialogue: 5,0:09:38.68,0:09:41.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everything's so huge!Dialogue: 5,0:09:43.18,0:09:46.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've never seen such a big city!Dialogue: 5,0:09:54.57,0:09:55.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?Dialogue: 5,0:09:55.51,0:09:57.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that crowd doing?Dialogue: 5,0:09:57.60,0:09:59.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're gawking at the shipyard?Dialogue: 5,0:09:59.60,0:10:03.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's check it out! Go, yagara!Dialogue: 5,0:10:10.00,0:10:14.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, look over there! It's Lucci-san ! He's so handsome!Dialogue: 5,0:10:14.80,0:10:16.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't Paulie here?Dialogue: 5,0:10:16.49,0:10:22.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lulu's here! So suave! He's truly a man among men.Dialogue: 5,0:10:22.14,0:10:25.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But nobody's manlier than Tilestone!Dialogue: 5,0:10:26.78,0:10:28.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Hey, old guy. – Hmm?Dialogue: 5,0:10:28.56,0:10:30.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?Dialogue: 5,0:10:30.15,0:10:35.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, some pirates tried stirring  up trouble at Dock One again.Dialogue: 5,0:10:35.70,0:10:40.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But, it ended with the craftsmen knocking them out, as usual.Dialogue: 5,0:10:40.18,0:10:42.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no shortage of idiots in the world.Dialogue: 5,0:10:42.07,0:10:45.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The shipwrights can beat up pirates?Dialogue: 5,0:10:45.79,0:10:48.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, you must be from out of town.Dialogue: 5,0:10:48.01,0:10:51.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That crowd, well, they're just busybodies.Dialogue: 5,0:10:52.38,0:10:57.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone 'round here admires  the Galley-La Company shipwrights.Dialogue: 5,0:10:57.05,0:10:59.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're strong...Dialogue: 5,0:10:59.05,0:11:00.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and skilled.Dialogue: 5,0:11:01.68,0:11:04.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're the pride of Water Seven.Dialogue: 5,0:11:08.43,0:11:10.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow! Can't wait to meet them!Dialogue: 5,0:11:11.77,0:11:13.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:11:13.81,0:11:15.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?Dialogue: 5,0:11:15.19,0:11:17.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry up and get to the currency exchange.Dialogue: 5,0:11:17.60,0:11:19.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can come back here later.Dialogue: 5,0:11:19.89,0:11:21.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 5,0:11:33.69,0:11:35.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the backstreet shopping district.Dialogue: 5,0:11:35.89,0:11:40.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They call a place this lively the backstreet?Dialogue: 5,0:11:40.90,0:11:43.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They have pedestrian areas too, huh?Dialogue: 5,0:11:43.49,0:11:45.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The water is clear, and the streets are beautiful.Dialogue: 5,0:11:45.90,0:11:47.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 5,0:11:50.14,0:11:52.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What's that?!Dialogue: 5,0:11:52.69,0:11:54.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a mask shop.Dialogue: 5,0:11:55.86,0:12:00.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've noticed people are walking around town wearing those masks.Dialogue: 5,0:12:00.30,0:12:04.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're wearing masks? I just thought they had weird faces.Dialogue: 5,0:12:07.85,0:12:10.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It seems there's a costume carnival on San Faldo.Dialogue: 5,0:12:10.49,0:12:13.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's an island you can reach using the sea train.Dialogue: 5,0:12:13.25,0:12:16.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? How do you know that?Dialogue: 5,0:12:16.15,0:12:18.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,People walking by are talking about it.Dialogue: 5,0:12:19.80,0:12:22.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised that you can hear them.Dialogue: 5,0:12:22.26,0:12:23.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a habit.Dialogue: 5,0:12:24.90,0:12:29.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since childhood, I survived by listening  to those around me and gauging their feelings.Dialogue: 5,0:12:31.79,0:12:33.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Robin.Dialogue: 5,0:12:40.70,0:12:42.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Doctor. – Hmm?Dialogue: 5,0:12:42.95,0:12:45.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Over there! It's a bookstore.Dialogue: 5,0:12:45.50,0:12:47.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?!Dialogue: 5,0:12:47.12,0:12:49.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can we?!Dialogue: 5,0:12:50.10,0:12:52.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course! Let's go inside.Dialogue: 5,0:12:52.76,0:12:54.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yay!Dialogue: 5,0:13:06.55,0:13:08.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm with CP9.Dialogue: 5,0:13:24.36,0:13:27.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin! I'm gonna go in, okay?Dialogue: 5,0:13:55.14,0:13:59.15,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,If I'm in my human form, it should be fine.Dialogue: 5,0:13:59.15,0:14:00.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh?Dialogue: 5,0:14:00.65,0:14:05.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, what a neat mask! What're you dressed up as?Dialogue: 5,0:14:05.39,0:14:08.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, y'know. A human reindeer.Dialogue: 5,0:14:11.21,0:14:12.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Glad you're having fun.Dialogue: 5,0:14:15.59,0:14:16.54,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh?Dialogue: 5,0:14:22.70,0:14:24.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin?Dialogue: 5,0:14:25.28,0:14:26.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hello?!Dialogue: 5,0:14:28.08,0:14:29.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin?!Dialogue: 5,0:15:05.51,0:15:08.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We thought we'd get you while you slept.Dialogue: 5,0:15:12.59,0:15:14.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are you creeps?!Dialogue: 5,0:15:15.50,0:15:16.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me!Dialogue: 5,0:15:16.93,0:15:20.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-One hundred million belly?!Dialogue: 5,0:15:20.08,0:15:23.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-Idiot! You're too loud! Everyone can hear you!Dialogue: 5,0:15:23.90,0:15:26.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-Y-You're gonna give us that much money?!Dialogue: 5,0:15:26.37,0:15:29.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,L-Like... Like I said, Luffy, you're too loud!Dialogue: 5,0:15:30.69,0:15:32.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is indeed worth that much.Dialogue: 5,0:15:32.91,0:15:36.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is incredibly pure gold with historical significance.Dialogue: 5,0:15:36.87,0:15:39.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With that much money, we can make the Merry as good as new!Dialogue: 5,0:15:39.99,0:15:42.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! With money to spare!Dialogue: 5,0:15:42.09,0:15:45.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice! Then we use the rest to buy a bronze statue!Dialogue: 5,0:15:45.33,0:15:46.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. No, we don't.Dialogue: 5,0:15:46.78,0:15:51.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you accept that amount, please sign and put your thumbprint here.Dialogue: 5,0:15:51.14,0:15:54.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll go prepare the cash immediately.Dialogue: 5,0:15:54.22,0:15:57.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay! I'll put however many thumbprints you want!Dialogue: 5,0:15:57.18,0:16:00.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If that's not enough, I'll put mine, too!Dialogue: 5,0:16:09.65,0:16:12.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? What's the matter, Nami?Dialogue: 5,0:16:12.31,0:16:17.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There're three things I want to say, Mr. Appraiser.Dialogue: 5,0:16:17.92,0:16:23.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First. I forgot to tell you, but this guy's got a 100 million bounty on his head.Dialogue: 5,0:16:25.00,0:16:26.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Second.Dialogue: 5,0:16:26.75,0:16:30.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't accept the appraisal you've just given us.Dialogue: 5,0:16:30.09,0:16:36.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Third. If you lie to us again, your head is ours.Dialogue: 5,0:16:36.01,0:16:37.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is all.Dialogue: 5,0:16:37.22,0:16:41.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,P-Please forgive me!Dialogue: 5,0:16:41.39,0:16:46.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-Three hundred million belly?! I'm not dreaming, am I?Dialogue: 5,0:16:46.40,0:16:50.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our adventure on Sky Island has finally paid off!Dialogue: 5,0:16:50.32,0:16:52.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm super rich!Dialogue: 5,0:16:52.53,0:16:53.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mean "we"!Dialogue: 5,0:16:54.54,0:16:56.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,P-Please come again!Dialogue: 5,0:16:56.80,0:17:01.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-I-It became 300 million! I-I'm scared!Dialogue: 5,0:17:01.35,0:17:03.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm carrying 100 million?Dialogue: 5,0:17:03.66,0:17:07.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, Nami's real good at making scary threats, huh?Dialogue: 5,0:17:07.44,0:17:11.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought it'd be worth about this much, but then he said 100 million.Dialogue: 5,0:17:11.70,0:17:14.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You two couldn't play it cool, so he tried to pull a fast one.Dialogue: 5,0:17:14.80,0:17:18.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey Luffy, you shouldn't swing it around like that!Dialogue: 5,0:17:18.51,0:17:22.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, anyway, I'm glad it went well.Dialogue: 5,0:17:23.48,0:17:26.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahh! The river!Dialogue: 5,0:17:26.44,0:17:29.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna lose 100 million belly to the river!Dialogue: 5,0:17:32.60,0:17:35.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Phew! That was close!Dialogue: 5,0:17:37.32,0:17:41.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna knock you out!Dialogue: 5,0:17:38.01,0:17:41.09,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna break your teeth, you bastard!Dialogue: 5,0:17:42.19,0:17:46.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-I'm... I'm sorry.Dialogue: 5,0:18:00.00,0:18:02.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Tell me!" he says?Dialogue: 5,0:18:02.81,0:18:05.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirate Hunter Zoro,Dialogue: 5,0:18:09.06,0:18:11.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we're bounty hunters!Dialogue: 5,0:18:11.40,0:18:15.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even a cryin’ child goes quiet when hearin' our name: the Franky Family!Dialogue: 5,0:18:16.64,0:18:20.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your head's worth 60 million! We'll gratefully take it.Dialogue: 5,0:18:20.98,0:18:23.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, we'll wait in ambush inside your ship...Dialogue: 5,0:18:23.91,0:18:26.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and catch the entire crew in one swoop.Dialogue: 5,0:18:28.49,0:18:30.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll make a killing! Lucky!Dialogue: 5,0:18:32.78,0:18:33.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm first!Dialogue: 5,0:18:36.81,0:18:38.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Lucky"?Dialogue: 5,0:18:41.01,0:18:42.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mean unlucky, right?Dialogue: 5,0:18:50.10,0:18:52.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stand tall!Dialogue: 5,0:18:52.77,0:18:54.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two-Sword Style:Dialogue: 5,0:18:55.72,0:18:58.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rhino Cycle!Dialogue: 5,0:19:09.51,0:19:11.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dumbasses.Dialogue: 5,0:19:13.50,0:19:14.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D-Dammit!Dialogue: 5,0:19:17.92,0:19:21.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Say, Nami, maybe we really should take it back to the ship.Dialogue: 5,0:19:21.93,0:19:25.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That'd be a waste of time. The shipyard is right over this hill.Dialogue: 5,0:19:25.89,0:19:29.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm a bit shocked you guys won't let me near the money.Dialogue: 5,0:19:29.85,0:19:32.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once we meet a shipwright,Dialogue: 5,0:19:32.25,0:19:35.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we'll need to go back to the  Merry with him right away...Dialogue: 5,0:19:35.45,0:19:37.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and have him give a repair estimate.Dialogue: 5,0:19:37.78,0:19:39.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see.Dialogue: 5,0:19:39.32,0:19:40.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That seems to be the case.Dialogue: 5,0:19:40.78,0:19:44.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm really not sure how to act. I've never carried around so much cash.Dialogue: 5,0:19:44.90,0:19:47.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, that's only natural.Dialogue: 5,0:19:47.30,0:19:49.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't understand why anyone  would just flail it around.Dialogue: 5,0:19:49.86,0:19:52.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! Hey, look over there!  They're selling hydro buns!Dialogue: 5,0:19:52.54,0:19:54.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's buy 100 of them!Dialogue: 5,0:19:53.21,0:19:54.06,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up.Dialogue: 5,0:19:54.06,0:19:55.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, let's buy 1,000 of them!Dialogue: 5,0:19:54.80,0:19:55.70,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up.Dialogue: 5,0:19:55.70,0:19:57.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then...Dialogue: 5,0:19:56.01,0:19:57.12,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 5,0:19:57.12,0:19:58.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 5,0:20:11.69,0:20:15.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here we are! Back at the shipyard entrance.Dialogue: 5,0:20:17.60,0:20:22.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good! Looks like the crowd from earlier is gone.Dialogue: 5,0:20:22.61,0:20:27.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's find... uhh... What's his name again?Dialogue: 5,0:20:27.62,0:20:29.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg-san.Dialogue: 5,0:20:29.19,0:20:31.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, that's it! Iceguy!Dialogue: 5,0:20:31.70,0:20:33.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder who he is.Dialogue: 5,0:20:33.64,0:20:37.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The old lady at the station told us to ask him.Dialogue: 5,0:20:37.56,0:20:38.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 5,0:20:38.59,0:20:42.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,More importantly, is it really okay to just walk on in?Dialogue: 5,0:20:42.59,0:20:44.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm coming in!Dialogue: 5,0:20:44.41,0:20:45.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not again!Dialogue: 5,0:20:46.80,0:20:49.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Halt!Dialogue: 5,0:20:48.04,0:20:49.06,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?Dialogue: 5,0:20:49.06,0:20:50.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold your horses.Dialogue: 5,0:20:50.60,0:20:52.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're an outsider, right?Dialogue: 5,0:20:52.10,0:20:56.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In that case, we'll converse outside.Dialogue: 5,0:20:57.37,0:21:01.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Only authorized individuals can amble about the shipyard.Dialogue: 5,0:21:04.36,0:21:06.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 5,0:21:09.29,0:21:11.83,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,Have you any business at this dock?Dialogue: 5,0:21:11.83,0:21:13.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you, Usopp.Dialogue: 5,0:21:13.60,0:21:16.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! I'm right here, Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:21:16.50,0:21:18.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right! The nose is square-ish!Dialogue: 5,0:21:18.79,0:21:23.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! Um. We'd like to see Iceburg-san.Dialogue: 5,0:21:23.69,0:21:26.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg-san, you say?  Are you a patron?Dialogue: 5,0:21:26.96,0:21:28.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, it's plain as day.Dialogue: 5,0:21:28.70,0:21:32.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It appears to be a referral from that old dame Kokoro at Shift Station.Dialogue: 5,0:21:32.06,0:21:35.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Are you an old guy?Dialogue: 5,0:21:35.09,0:21:36.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm 23.Dialogue: 5,0:21:36.80,0:21:40.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,23? You talk like you're  way older than us.Dialogue: 5,0:21:41.96,0:21:43.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Folks often tell me that.Dialogue: 5,0:21:43.29,0:21:45.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, do you know this Iceburg person?Dialogue: 5,0:21:45.90,0:21:51.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Know him? Why, Iceburg-san is the mayor of Water Seven.Dialogue: 5,0:21:51.87,0:21:55.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh. So he's some kinda big shot.Dialogue: 5,0:21:55.71,0:21:57.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not only is he the mayor,Dialogue: 5,0:21:57.90,0:22:00.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he's the president of Galley-La Company,Dialogue: 5,0:22:00.69,0:22:02.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and he also manages the sea train.Dialogue: 5,0:22:02.50,0:22:04.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So he's the top guy here!Dialogue: 5,0:22:04.10,0:22:07.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, he's a man of no small repute in Water Seven.Dialogue: 5,0:22:07.84,0:22:09.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where do we meet him?Dialogue: 5,0:22:09.80,0:22:12.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm, wherever could he be?Dialogue: 5,0:22:12.72,0:22:17.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He can be hard to find since he's always buzzing about.Dialogue: 5,0:22:17.19,0:22:20.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aw! Can't you reach out to him for us?Dialogue: 5,0:22:20.67,0:22:23.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's certainly possible. Is the matter urgent?Dialogue: 5,0:22:23.74,0:22:25.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not that we're in a hurry, but...Dialogue: 5,0:22:27.11,0:22:31.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In short, you want to discuss having your ship repaired, right?Dialogue: 5,0:22:31.87,0:22:33.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where did you drop anchor?Dialogue: 5,0:22:33.92,0:22:35.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Some rocky cape.Dialogue: 5,0:22:35.70,0:22:40.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right. Then I'll pop on over and survey your ship's condition.Dialogue: 5,0:22:40.95,0:22:44.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It'll save some time when you see Iceburg-san.Dialogue: 5,0:22:44.25,0:22:46.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can talk about the repair fee, too.Dialogue: 5,0:22:46.88,0:22:50.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Pop on over"? As in, on a yagara bull?Dialogue: 5,0:22:52.39,0:22:58.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I do that, and you folks'll wait a month of Sundays. Instead, I'll return in ten minutes.Dialogue: 5,0:22:58.44,0:23:00.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ten minutes?Dialogue: 5,0:23:00.44,0:23:03.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Precisely. Ten minutes.Dialogue: 5,0:23:06.51,0:23:07.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!Dialogue: 5,0:23:09.78,0:23:11.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– He's fast! – Whoooa!Dialogue: 5,0:23:13.56,0:23:14.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 5,0:23:14.83,0:23:17.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahh! He jumped!Dialogue: 5,0:23:19.79,0:23:23.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! But wait! Over there is...Dialogue: 5,0:23:23.25,0:23:24.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a drop-off!Dialogue: 5,0:23:24.67,0:23:26.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahh! He fell!Dialogue: 5,0:23:35.60,0:23:37.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Amazing!Dialogue: 5,0:23:37.31,0:23:39.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is he okay?Dialogue: 5,0:23:39.79,0:23:43.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He runs freely through town.Dialogue: 5,0:23:43.14,0:23:44.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 5,0:23:44.42,0:23:44.98,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 5,0:23:44.98,0:23:46.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Known as the Mountain Wind,Dialogue: 5,0:23:47.61,0:23:52.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he's one of the foremen of  Galley-La Company's Dock One:Dialogue: 5,0:23:54.87,0:23:55.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaku.Dialogue: 5,0:24:00.00,0:24:03.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, well. I see.Dialogue: 5,0:24:03.79,0:24:08.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The City of Water. This is amazing!Dialogue: 5,0:24:08.04,0:24:12.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Clear springs and rivers. Clean streets and lively crowds.Dialogue: 5,0:24:12.70,0:24:15.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And many pretty women.Dialogue: 5,0:24:15.19,0:24:20.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna take Nami-san or Robin-chan out in a town like this!Dialogue: 5,0:24:20.77,0:24:23.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Having a beauty on each arm would be nice too.Dialogue: 5,0:24:26.29,0:24:29.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This side is Nami-san, and this side is Robin-chan.Dialogue: 5,0:24:29.60,0:24:32.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, mister. Stop making that weird face.Dialogue: 5,0:24:32.90,0:24:35.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So which hydro cabbage are you gonna buy?Dialogue: 5,0:24:35.62,0:24:39.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? Oh, yes, I'll buy both. Oh, and...Dialogue: 5,0:24:39.80,0:24:43.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want to get some food that's in season from this town. What's available?Dialogue: 5,0:24:43.83,0:24:47.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's see. Hmm? What the heck?Dialogue: 5,0:24:47.09,0:24:49.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, walking around here is pretty inconvenient.Dialogue: 5,0:24:52.78,0:24:55.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Another dead end? What a drag.Dialogue: 5,0:24:55.94,0:24:58.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did I get lost? This is no good.Dialogue: 5,0:24:58.93,0:25:02.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's too much like a certain swordsmoron.Dialogue: 5,0:25:02.49,0:25:03.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 5,0:25:09.32,0:25:12.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! Robin-chan !Dialogue: 5,0:25:13.00,0:25:15.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hello! It's me! Yoo-hoo!Dialogue: 5,0:25:15.24,0:25:18.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin-cha- ah!Dialogue: 5,0:25:18.61,0:25:20.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 5,0:25:21.81,0:25:23.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She disappeared?Dialogue: 5,0:25:23.50,0:25:25.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When there're no doors or streets?Dialogue: 5,0:25:26.88,0:25:29.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did she fly or something?Dialogue: 5,0:25:29.29,0:25:29.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 5,0:25:33.08,0:25:34.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp?Dialogue: 5,0:25:35.40,0:25:40.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This town is a bit off.  Or am I the one who's off here?Dialogue: 5,0:25:52.69,0:25:56.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, that must be the ship.Dialogue: 5,0:25:59.71,0:26:00.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.Dialogue: 5,0:26:04.34,0:26:06.87,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just Usopp.Dialogue: 5,0:26:06.87,0:26:10.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. It's damaged.Dialogue: 5,0:26:15.11,0:26:17.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The mast needs to be replaced, too.Dialogue: 5,0:26:19.30,0:26:21.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp...?Dialogue: 5,0:26:22.56,0:26:25.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there! Who the hell are you?!Dialogue: 5,0:26:25.71,0:26:28.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, forgive me. I interrupted your siesta.Dialogue: 5,0:26:29.24,0:26:31.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, man! What a surprise!Dialogue: 5,0:26:31.68,0:26:33.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He jumped from there!Dialogue: 5,0:26:33.94,0:26:37.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, my shipwrights are anything but ordinary.Dialogue: 5,0:26:37.53,0:26:39.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, who's this guy?Dialogue: 5,0:26:39.01,0:26:39.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beats me.Dialogue: 5,0:26:39.89,0:26:43.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If one so wishes to speedily build a faster, more capable vessel,Dialogue: 5,0:26:43.69,0:26:46.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ordinary physical abilities just won't do.Dialogue: 5,0:26:46.80,0:26:48.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalifa, before we begin...Dialogue: 5,0:26:48.09,0:26:49.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, I've already checked.Dialogue: 5,0:26:50.81,0:26:55.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy, Pirate Hunter Zoro, Nico Robin:Dialogue: 5,0:26:56.42,0:26:59.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are three crew members with bounties on their heads.Dialogue: 5,0:26:59.09,0:27:01.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their total bounty is 239 million belly.Dialogue: 5,0:27:01.99,0:27:03.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Founded in the East Blue.Dialogue: 5,0:27:03.43,0:27:07.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Known as the Straw Hats, seven crew members strong.Dialogue: 5,0:27:07.09,0:27:09.39,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-They have us made.Dialogue: 5,0:27:09.39,0:27:11.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. I'm glad you came.Dialogue: 5,0:27:11.45,0:27:14.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Iceburg, the boss of this city.Dialogue: 5,0:27:14.40,0:27:17.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And this is a mouse I found earlier.Dialogue: 5,0:27:17.40,0:27:19.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His name is... let's see...Dialogue: 5,0:27:19.50,0:27:21.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tyrannosaurus.Dialogue: 5,0:27:21.32,0:27:23.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have to prepare his food and cage.Dialogue: 5,0:27:23.30,0:27:25.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Already taken care of, Iceburg-san.Dialogue: 5,0:27:25.70,0:27:27.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, that's Kalifa for you.Dialogue: 5,0:27:27.33,0:27:29.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir.Dialogue: 5,0:27:29.60,0:27:32.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,More importantly, you're dining with an executive...Dialogue: 5,0:27:32.64,0:27:34.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from a glassware factory at the hotel in Chiza in ten minutes.Dialogue: 5,0:27:34.95,0:27:37.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After that, you'll give a talk at Liguria Plaza.Dialogue: 5,0:27:37.59,0:27:41.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When that's done, a conference with Mayor Bimine of Pucci, the Gourmet Town.Dialogue: 5,0:27:41.95,0:27:44.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll also be interviewed by a newspaper company there.Dialogue: 5,0:27:44.76,0:27:49.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finally, you'll need to return to the office to conduct a little paperwork.Dialogue: 5,0:27:50.12,0:27:51.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't wanna!Dialogue: 5,0:27:52.44,0:27:54.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Very well. I'll cancel them all.Dialogue: 5,0:27:54.73,0:27:56.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Is that okay?!Dialogue: 5,0:27:56.65,0:28:00.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With all this clout,  I can occasionally do something like that.Dialogue: 5,0:28:00.23,0:28:03.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're completely unfit to be a mayor.Dialogue: 5,0:28:03.30,0:28:05.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's pretty selfish of you!Dialogue: 5,0:28:05.51,0:28:08.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So this guy is the one that old lady was talking about?Dialogue: 5,0:28:08.80,0:28:10.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's that guy.Dialogue: 5,0:28:10.62,0:28:12.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How shameless!Dialogue: 5,0:28:19.40,0:28:21.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What'd you do that for?!Dialogue: 5,0:28:21.00,0:28:22.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!Dialogue: 5,0:28:28.23,0:28:31.24,Main-207+,,0,0,8,,How dare you refer to one of the world's leading shipwrights...Dialogue: 5,0:28:31.24,0:28:33.48,Main-207+,,0,0,8,,as "this guy" and "that guy"!?Dialogue: 5,0:28:33.48,0:28:34.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on?Dialogue: 5,0:28:34.98,0:28:37.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The secretary Kalifa had one of her rare explosions!Dialogue: 5,0:28:37.55,0:28:38.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna be kicked by her too.Dialogue: 5,0:28:38.98,0:28:42.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pardon me. I lost my composure for a moment.Dialogue: 5,0:28:42.49,0:28:46.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Regardless, Iceburg-san is a local celebrity.  Please mind your manners.Dialogue: 5,0:28:46.91,0:28:51.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Try not to get Kalifa angry. When she gets angry,Dialogue: 5,0:28:51.16,0:28:53.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,she gets indiscriminate.Dialogue: 5,0:28:54.91,0:28:57.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You kicked your own boss too!Dialogue: 5,0:28:57.31,0:28:58.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mind your own manners!Dialogue: 5,0:28:58.38,0:29:02.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, but anyway, you're Iceburg-san, right?Dialogue: 5,0:29:03.26,0:29:05.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please look at this. It's a referral.Dialogue: 5,0:29:05.34,0:29:07.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From old lady Kokoro?Dialogue: 5,0:29:07.90,0:29:10.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Take a look at their ship," huh?Dialogue: 5,0:29:11.00,0:29:12.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 5,0:29:12.31,0:29:16.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! You won't?! Please! Please repair our ship!Dialogue: 5,0:29:16.49,0:29:18.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have money!Dialogue: 5,0:29:18.20,0:29:22.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Merry is all beat up after our voyages! C'mon, old guy!Dialogue: 5,0:29:22.69,0:29:25.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just like that! So it's okay?!Dialogue: 5,0:29:22.69,0:29:23.89,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 5,0:29:25.70,0:29:27.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then why did you rip it up?Dialogue: 5,0:29:24.79,0:29:25.70,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep.Dialogue: 5,0:29:27.70,0:29:29.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her lipstick marks made me uncomfortable.Dialogue: 5,0:29:29.71,0:29:32.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Old lady Kokoro and I have been drinking pals for ages.Dialogue: 5,0:29:32.45,0:29:35.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, that aside, Kaku has  already left to make an assessment.Dialogue: 5,0:29:35.90,0:29:38.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The matter is well underway. Don't fret.Dialogue: 5,0:29:40.48,0:29:43.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was bored today anyway.Dialogue: 5,0:29:43.01,0:29:44.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Want a tour of the shipyard?Dialogue: 5,0:29:44.69,0:29:46.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Seriously?Dialogue: 5,0:29:46.28,0:29:47.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then, follow me.Dialogue: 5,0:29:47.39,0:29:50.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Awfully random for a man who just canceled his appointments.Dialogue: 5,0:29:50.35,0:29:52.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right! We're gonna see the shipyard!Dialogue: 5,0:29:53.79,0:29:55.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. The money.Dialogue: 5,0:29:56.40,0:29:58.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The money? What?Dialogue: 5,0:29:58.50,0:30:00.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? What? What?Dialogue: 5,0:30:00.57,0:30:02.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 5,0:30:03.45,0:30:06.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Everything okay, Usopp?Dialogue: 5,0:30:07.20,0:30:10.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-Th-The money... The money is gone!Dialogue: 5,0:30:10.45,0:30:11.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 5,0:30:11.91,0:30:13.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look everywhere!Dialogue: 5,0:30:13.36,0:30:16.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's gone! I can't find it anywhere!Dialogue: 5,0:30:14.19,0:30:16.91,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Huh?Dialogue: 5,0:30:17.46,0:30:18.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 5,0:30:18.83,0:30:21.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahh! Over there!Dialogue: 5,0:30:27.80,0:30:31.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, you crooks! Just who the  hell are you?! Who are you?!Dialogue: 5,0:30:31.31,0:30:33.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you taking our money?!Dialogue: 5,0:30:33.90,0:30:36.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hold it!Dialogue: 5,0:30:38.33,0:30:39.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the dough!Dialogue: 5,0:30:40.51,0:30:45.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give us our money back!Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.33,0:11:33.17,Captions,,0,0,0,,Water Seven Backstreet Shopping AreaDialogue: 1,0:11:26.33,0:11:33.17,Captions,,0,0,0,,Water Seven Backstreet Shopping AreaDialogue: 0,0:15:17.47,0:15:23.90,Captions,,0,0,0,,Currency ExchangeDialogue: 1,0:15:17.47,0:15:23.90,Captions,,0,0,0,,Currency ExchangeDialogue: 0,0:21:06.74,0:21:11.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,Kaku Shipwright Galley-La CompanyDialogue: 1,0:21:06.74,0:21:11.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,Kaku Shipwright Galley-La CompanyDialogue: 0,0:27:09.48,0:27:14.40,Captions,,0,0,0,,Iceburg Water Seven Mayor Galley-La Company PresidentDialogue: 1,0:27:09.48,0:27:14.40,Captions,,0,0,0,,Iceburg Water Seven Mayor Galley-La Company PresidentDialogue: 0,0:28:28.35,0:28:33.48,Captions,,0,0,0,,Kalifa Iceburg's 