alogue: 0,0:00:55.06,0:00:58.55,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Our journey's fraught with injuryDialogue: 0,0:00:58.56,0:01:02.27,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,But what we cherish most is right at our sideDialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:06.35,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,And if you get into a jamDialogue: 0,0:01:06.45,0:01:08.36,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,I'll always be there to protect youDialogue: 0,0:01:09.45,0:01:13.36,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,It's all right! It's time to move onDialogue: 0,0:01:13.66,0:01:16.82,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,The sun shines always in our heartsDialogue: 0,0:01:17.17,0:01:20.33,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Shoulder to shoulder, we face all coming stormsDialogue: 0,0:01:20.37,0:01:24.20,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,And look to the future for the light of hopeDialogue: 0,0:01:24.67,0:01:27.92,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,If we gather up the pieces of our dreamsDialogue: 0,0:01:28.39,0:01:31.55,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,They'll make a chart leading to tomorrowDialogue: 0,0:01:31.68,0:01:34.72,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,We come together under the same Jolly RogerDialogue: 0,0:01:35.10,0:01:40.45,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,And make our wishes come true; together, we are...Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.27,0:00:04.97,Karaoke-OP5,,0,0,0,fx,m -9 4 l -8 -21 l -6 4 l 4 -5 l -5 5 l 19 7 l -5 8 l 5 18 l -6 9 l -7 33 l -9 9 l -19 18 l -10 7 l -34 6 l -10 5 l -20 -6Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.27,0:00:04.97,Karaoke-OP5,,0,0,0,fx,m -9 4 l -8 -21 l -6 4 l 4 -5 l -5 5 l 19 7 l -5 8 l 5 18 l -6 9 l -7 33 l -9 9 l -19 18 l -10 7 l -34 6 l -10 5 l -20 -6Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.27,0:00:04.97,Karaoke-OP5,,0,0,0,fx,m 1 -5 l 4 -62 l 6 -5 l 30 -25 l 8 -3 l 69 -1 l 8 2 l 30 26 l 6 4 l 3 62 l 1 4 l -24 26 l -2 2 l -62 -1 l -2 -3 l -24 -25Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.27,0:00:04.97,Karaoke-OP5,,0,0,0,fx,m 1 -5 l 4 -62 l 6 -5 l 30 -25 l 8 -3 l 69 -1 l 8 2 l 30 26 l 6 4 l 3 62 l 1 4 l -24 26 l -2 2 l -62 -1 l -2 -3 l -24 -25Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.27,0:00:04.97,Karaoke-OP5,,0,0,0,fx,m 1 -5 l 4 -62 l 6 -5 l 30 -25 l 8 -3 l 69 -1 l 8 2 l 30 26 l 6 4 l 3 62 l 1 4 l -24 26 l -2 2 l -62 -1 l -2 -3 l -24 -25Dialogue